  "description": "Find the number of unique k-diff pairs in an array where a pair is (nums[i], nums[j]) such that |nums[i] - nums[j]| == k.",
  "target": 2,
  "pseudocode": "1. map = new Map();\n2. for num of nums: map.set(num, (map.get(num) || 0) + 1);\n3. count = 0;\n4. for [key, val] of map:\n5. if (k > 0 && map.has(key + k)) count++;\n6. else if (k === 0 && val > 1) count++;",
  "steps": [
